If you were advising a public family counseling service on how to respond to similar cases, what would you recommend?:
"A" = Fully support her autonomy—having children should be a personal choice, not a social obligation.
"B" = Encourage reflection on how childbearing contributes to social stability and personal fulfillment.
"C" = Provide balanced guidance that presents both traditional expectations and individual choice.
